    {
      "id": "claim_a667291e43764171a8d13e394cd3619c",
      "statement": "HO-5 2015-01 is superseded by HO-5 2022-06 for policies effective on or after 2022-06-01, but remains applicable to policies written under the older edition; the later edition is not retroactive merely because it exists in the form library.",
