    {
      "id": "claim_043530f30e554c49897aff0f460e3a63",
      "statement": "Both HO-5 editions provide a broad risk-of-direct-physical-loss property grant rather than a short named-peril list, but payment still requires physical alteration or damage and remains subject to limits, deductibles, exclusions, location rules, special limits, and post-loss conditions; Coverage C mysterious disappearance is excluded unless evidence establishes theft or another covered cause.",
