    {
      "id": "claim_2272a10fcbd64a13b6f357fb6fc21d9c",
      "statement": "The standard HO-5 property limits are 10% of Coverage A for Coverage B, 50% of Coverage A for Coverage C, and 20% of Coverage A for Coverage D in both 2015-01 and 2022-06. Coverage A uses replacement-cost settlement when insurance is at least 80% of full replacement cost and otherwise settles at actual cash value, subject to the edition's terms; 2022-06 additionally states replacement-cost treatment for roof surfacing unless an ACV roof-schedule endorsement applies.",
