    {
      "id": "claim_a12e8e66f7324045808603fc891781b3",
      "statement": "Coverage C special limits materially increase in 2022-06 for jewelry theft from $2,500 to $3,000, firearms theft from $3,000 to $3,500, watercraft from $1,000 to $2,000, business property on the residence premises from $2,500 to $5,000, and electronic apparatus in a motor vehicle from $1,000 to $2,000; the $300 money or precious-metals limit and $5,000 silverware theft limit remain stated, while the 2022-06 form retains the 50% aggregate Coverage C limit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/MS/HO-5/2015-01.md#L254-L290",
