    {
      "id": "claim_65f2c966c4004487bc6f877b7d9af91c",
      "statement": "The principal additional-coverages amounts in the supplied 2015-01 and 2022-06 texts are aligned: debris removal can receive an additional 10% when the applicable limit is exhausted, vegetation is 5% of Coverage A with a $1,000 per-item limit, fire-department service charge is $1,000, card and forgery or counterfeit loss is $2,500, loss assessment is $2,500, ordinance-or-law coverage is 15% of Coverage A within Coverage A, landlord's furnishings are $2,500, grave markers are $7,500, and refrigerated property is $1,500. Additional limits do not create coverage for excluded property or causes.",
