    {
      "id": "claim_5a06f1bae0ce4c7c9821a3d5757c92a4",
      "statement": "Both editions exclude major property-loss boundaries including flood and surface water, underground water, sewer or sump backup, earth movement, ordinance-or-law costs, governmental action, war, nuclear hazard, pollutants, deterioration, mechanical breakdown, faulty work, mold or microbial conditions, repeated seepage, vacancy-related losses, construction theft, and unexplained disappearance; both preserve resulting direct physical loss only where the applicable wording independently covers it, and 2022-06 expressly addresses roof-surfacing and cosmetic roof treatment.",
