      "id": "claim_9c972efb627c44f38b37a532d807c229",
      "statement": "HO 04 65 Coverage C — Increased Special Limits changes only the expressly increased Coverage C special limits; it does not create coverage, alter a peril, remove exclusions, change valuation, or eliminate a deductible. Its stated theft limits are $5,000 for jewelry, watches, and precious stones, $6,500 for firearms, and $10,000 for silverware, and repository metadata identifies it as an HO-3 endorsement whose attachment to an HO-5 must be confirmed.",
